ONE HOUR LEFT!

Get your Mint face  on and grab that Tier 1 Access!

@everyone

Congrats to all of you! Some awesome vehicles popping up in general chat. Also...

I have noticed quite a few questions regarding what will happen in the event we do not sell out after Tier 5 is completed. To answer your question, we have decided that in that scenario we will not mint the remainder of the supply. To be clear, this will not be a burn, but it will be an exact number minted based on demand and once the policy closes, that supply will be set in stone.

@everyone 

NFTs are starting to ship to wallets. Our final supply for the Valley Raceworx T3 is 4500. 

Thank you again!
